# Airwindows Consolidated for WebCLAP

Airwindows Consolidated by Paul Walker (BaconPaul), every Airwindows effect by Chris Johnson in one plugin, ported to
WebCLAP. This is not an official Airwindows or Airwindows Consolidated release.

- Airwindows Consolidated: https://github.com/baconpaul/airwin2rack (commit d8fe301)
- Airwindows: https://www.airwindows.com, https://github.com/airwindows/airwindows
- This port, and the complete source of this bundle: @SOURCE_URL@
  Build it with `scripts/build-airwindows.sh`, which fetches every dependency below at the commit named here.

## License

The bundle as a whole is licensed under the **GNU Affero General Public License, version 3** (`LICENSE`).

Airwindows Consolidated and the Airwindows effects are MIT (`licenses/MIT-Airwindows-Consolidated.txt`). Both
modules contain the JUCE framework (the DSP module its GUI-free part), used under the AGPL-3.0, so `module.wasm`
and `ui/ui.wasm` are AGPL-3.0.

This program is distributed in the hope that it will be useful, but WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY; without even the implied
warranty of MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE. See the licenses for details.

